{
  "searchString": "Direct Detail URL: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Quality%20Roofing%20Express&query_place_id=ChIJT3NpTdXZxIkRXrlxdqrgXIk",
  "reviewerId": "108628447645868879698",
  "reviewerUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108628447645868879698?hl=en",
  "name": "Sandy Berardi",
  "reviewerNumberOfReviews": 1,
  "isLocalGuide": false,
  "reviewerPhotoUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXCT4GKTEP_9GdT5PD6WLh_L189Kgql1zlC3aQV3G-qobeIl10=s1920-c-rp-mo-br100",
  "text": "Hired to put new roof and gutters and siding on my home, roof and gutters no problem, the siding started rippling immediately, they strung us along claimed they were in touch with the manufactures, turned out they didn’t do anything and the owner claims it’s not their problem it’s the manufacturer and we need to have them fix it, so a year later my house looks horrible with rippled siding and on our own to fix it, and we did go through manufacturer who stated it was a installed wrong and not defected, which we have documentation from the manufacturer stating this",
  "textTranslated": null,
  "publishAt": "Edited a year ago",
  "publishedAtDate": "2024-12-24T13:04:27.957Z",
  "likesCount": 1,
  "reviewId": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtZzVDOFdBEAE",
  "reviewUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQtZzVDOFdBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x895ce0aa7671b95e!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID-g5C8WA%7C%7C?hl=en",
  "reviewOrigin": "Google",
  "stars": 1,
  "rating": null,
  "responseFromOwnerDate": "2022-12-07T18:41:04.000Z",
  "responseFromOwnerText": "Mrs . Daugherty that is because it is a manufacture defect, we did get in touch with the manufacture and were given instructions to ask your husband as the home to file a claim . They sent you directly paperwork and instructions on what to do . We came to your house to remove pieces of the defected siding and sent them in to the manufacture they were to get in touch directly with you . All we could do to help you we did . Other than that it is a matter that needs to be resolved between you and the manufacture. If they need anything other information from our company we would be glad to answer them . I’m sorry you don’t seem to understand that part of the manufacture claims department . We can not put in the claim for you , you need to do the process .",
