{
  "searchString": "Direct Detail URL: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Quality%20Roofing%20Express&query_place_id=ChIJT3NpTdXZxIkRXrlxdqrgXIk",
  "reviewerId": "102444287438794141744",
  "reviewerUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102444287438794141744?hl=en",
  "name": "Tom Belinsky",
  "reviewerNumberOfReviews": 2,
  "isLocalGuide": false,
  "reviewerPhotoUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJscit83u7Sd_Uu7qOllzFIJl0X1OuorRlxPgoSqaQaMAyMTg=s1920-c-rp-mo-br100",
  "text": "I have personally had Osman and his team do three roofs for me and they are currently working on a roof for my son. From the moment I met Osman 5 years ago to the present, he has been the consummate professional. The quality of work and the attention to detail are second to none. He personally manages every job and pays close attention to every detail. He is aware at all times of what his team is doing. He only uses the highest quality roofing materials and his installation standards are well above the industry norm. Myself and my family have had a couple of weather-related roofing emergencies on both residential and commercial properties. Osman and his team were onsite within a couple of hours to secure the roofs and prevent further damage until they could come back and do the complete repairs.  If you are looking for true roofing professionals that will do your job right the first time at a very fair price, then call Osman and Yuvannia at Quality Roofing Express. Osman and Yuvannia are a family owned, and family operated roofing business. I can personally say that they treat their customers like family. I'm not normally one to take the time to write reviews but I should've taken the time to write this review a long time ago. If I could give more than 5 stars I certainly would. Thank you Osman, Yuvannia and your team at Quality Roofing Express. My roofing team for life.",
