{
  "searchString": "Direct Detail URL: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Quality%20Roofing%20Express&query_place_id=ChIJT3NpTdXZxIkRXrlxdqrgXIk",
  "reviewerId": "109210544696233362189",
  "reviewerUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109210544696233362189?hl=en",
  "name": "Alexander Jimenez",
  "reviewerNumberOfReviews": 7,
  "isLocalGuide": false,
  "reviewerPhotoUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0S4be1rn8exEuyKzDE6YqmqY4sx2Mv6moafyJek1TZSnUKsaCJQ=s1920-c-rp-mo-br100",
  "text": "I am very disappointed with this company. I called to have my roof checked out, I separated time specifically at their convenience for them to come see my home. They are about an hour away from my home and call me about an hour and a half prior to tell me that they are preparing to come down now, but that they cannot place a tarp on my slate shingle roof. They gave good reason, the tarp requires nails/screws to secure it and this could cause more leaks if they break during installation. I agreed and said it’s very understandable. I did say even still I would like an estimate to replace the whole roof over my home and if possible. I want to remove all the slate and replace it with traditional shingles. I did ask if they had any other options to patch up a small hole and I was told they would call back. I waited until quarter after the time they said they were going to arrive to call and verify that they were still coming. I left a message as they did not answer the phone. I then waited for one hour for them to show up or at least call me back and nothing. I felt like this was very unprofessional. I at least deserved a call stating that they wanted to cancel the appointment whether it be not worth their time and effort, they just didn’t have a product to fix the roof, or they didn’t want to take the job. This definitely left me with a bad taste in my mouth when it comes to trusting a company to do the bare minimum.",
  "textTranslated": null,
  "publishAt": "2 years ago",
  "publishedAtDate": "2024-06-19T20:07:02.149Z",
  "likesCount": 0,
  "reviewId": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMZ1pYVFl3EAE",
  "reviewUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMZ1pYVFl3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x895ce0aa7671b95e!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICLgZXTYw%7C%7C?hl=en",
  "reviewOrigin": "Google",
  "stars": 1,
  "rating": null,
  "responseFromOwnerDate": "2024-06-19T20:42:48.000Z",
  "responseFromOwnerText": "We are sorry you feel disappointed, as much as we try to make it to every appointment some jobs we just can’t take . We did try many ways to let you know , we would not be able to help you and even suggested calling other companies that we know would be able to help you with your slate roof and you refused to take their name . We tried to cancel the appointment with you , so we didn’t waste your time, because we were not going to be able to help you out . We did call and left a message explaining that we were not going to be able to help you out and that we were not going to take the job . Wish we could have been of further assistance but you didn’t want any other recommendations. ",
